        "description": "An object representing an [onSuccess](https://plaid.com/docs/link/web/#onsuccess) callback from Link. This field is returned only for legacy integrations and is deprecated in favor of [`results.item_add_results`](https://plaid.com/docs/api/link/#link-token-get-response-link-sessions-results-item-add-results) which can support multiple public tokens in a single Link session, for flows such as multi-Item Link. If you are receiving `on_success`, contact your Account Manager to migrate to `results.item_add_results` instead.",
