            "description": "The ID of the category to which this transaction belongs. See [Categories](https://plaid.com/docs/api/products/transactions/#categoriesget).\n\nAll implementations are encouraged to use the new `personal_finance_category` instead of `category`. `personal_finance_category` provides more meaningful categorization and greater accuracy.",
            "nullable": true,
