        "description": "The `/cra/check_report/verification/pdf/get` endpoint retrieves the most recent Consumer Report in PDF format, specifically formatted for Home Lending verification use cases. Before calling this endpoint, ensure that you've created a VOA report through Link or the `/cra/check_report/create` endpoint, and have received a `CHECK_REPORT_READY` or a `USER_CHECK_REPORT_READY` webhook.\n\nThe response to `/cra/check_report/verification/pdf/get` is the PDF binary data. The `request_id`  is returned in the `Plaid-Request-ID` header.",
